1
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,120
Then, take a step back and take a look.

2
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,280
Anyone without money, come to me.

3
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:28,960
I don't have any either, but don't worry.

4
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,800
Look at the blue sky.

5
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,300
White clouds.

6
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:42,740
Oh well, it'll all work out somehow, right?

7
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:59,920
Anyone without a job, come to me.

8
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:04,500
I don't have one either, but don't worry.

9
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:11,960
Look, even the burning Akaneru.

10
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:18,260
It'll all work out somehow, right?

11
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:23,520
You get it, right? Got it, got it.

12
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:27,460
Once you understand, shut up and follow me.

13
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:44,240
Angel Seven vs. Wild Bastard Squad

14
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:50,020
This is the petit patrol that will
replace the current mini-patrol car.

15
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:55,600
With its introduction,
more detailed patrols will be possible.

16
00:01:56,860 --> 00:02:00,500
Even for purse-snatchings on mini-bikes,
which have been increasing in recent years,

17
00:02:00,940 --> 00:02:03,980
we can't chase them once they escape
into the alleys in a mini-patrol car,

18
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:07,800
but with this petit patrol,
we can pursue them anywhere.

19
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:08,600
I see.

20
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:11,800
Scooters are automatic and highly maneuverable,
after all.

21
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,660
I understand that, but...

22
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:15,740
You've bought too many uniforms!

23
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:21,020
And these are the new uniforms.

24
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:23,780
Petit Patrol Girls vs. Lady Riders

25
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:25,620
They're the Angel Seven.

26
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:30,400
Strike some different poses.

27
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,200
Raise one leg and do a wing pose.

28
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:36,420
They're really popular

29
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:38,840
It's like a motor show.

30
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:42,940
It's basically like having
show hostesses out on patrol.

31
00:02:42,940 --> 00:02:45,160
They're flashier than race queens!

32
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:50,400
But why wasn't Otohime,
the White Plum officer, picked for the team?

33
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,800
There was talk of her
joining the team, but...

34
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,060
The costume...

35
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,320
Well, that's that, then.

36
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,640
Alright, let's stop filming there
and try an actual criminal arrest.

37
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:11,160
This way, please.

38
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,360
These two little thieves,

39
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:21,060
Ugh! It's the 21st century,
so please stop with that thief image.

40
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:24,300
Nobody's ever actually
seen a thief like that.

41
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:26,640
That's a giant statue we ended
up making for a comedy sketch.

42
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:29,100
So what do we do, then?

43
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:31,500
If they're escaping on a bike,
we'll need one, right?

44
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:41,360
A Honda And me, who knows every back alley of the old town,
the two of us will keep running all day!

45
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:48,100
Chief, that should be fine, I suppose...
but will it really be all right?

46
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:55,580
Hey, Plug! As a team, we'll catch you in no time.
You'll be our guest later, okay?

47
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:58,300
A motorcycle cop pro playing the criminal?

48
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:00,020
This'll make a good article.

49
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:03,280
No way, I can't play the criminal!

50
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,320
Don't worry, you'll get away easily.

51
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:05,940
No!

52
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:08,380
Try to catch me!

53
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:13,020
Alright, let's run!

54
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:15,680
As if we'd get caught by a cosplay scooter!

55
00:04:17,500 --> 00:04:19,780
Both of them are incredibly fast!

56
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:22,080
Can we really catch them?

57
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,380
Angel Seven formed!

58
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:28,380
Yes, understood.

59
00:04:28,380 --> 00:04:30,580
We'll catch that guy in no time.

60
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:31,860
I'll make the arrest.

61
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:33,420
We'll corner them right away.

62
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,200
OK, let's go.

63
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:37,440
Angel Seven, move out!

64
00:04:38,020 --> 00:04:39,480
The car chase is about to begin!

65
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,380
Let's go after them!

66
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:48,520
There they are!

67
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:50,380
Two suspects spotted.

68
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:51,260
Roger.

69
00:04:51,260 --> 00:04:52,800
Auto-cruise on.

70
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:57,140
Marking them.

71
00:04:57,940 --> 00:04:59,120
A rifle?!

72
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,080
What is it?

73
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,680
Paint rounds!

74
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,760
N-System hit.

75
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:11,180
Turn left at the next one,
we'll pincer them.

76
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:12,220
Roger.

77
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,620
We're really standing out!

78
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:21,400
Damn, they're using weapons!

79
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:23,620
You two vehicles there, stop!

80
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:27,160
From the front, too!

81
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:27,640
Damn it!

82
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:30,100
Force through the blockade! Don't rush in!

83
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:33,280
They have no intention of stopping.

84
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:33,780
Ugh!

85
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:35,300
We're forcing you to stop!

86
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:37,680
Fire!

87
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,840
Don't let them get the upper hand!

88
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:43,960
Megu-ichi!

89
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,500
That really hurts!

90
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,800
It hurts! My eyes hurt!

91
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,400
Calm down and behave!

92
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:57,140
We caught them in twenty minutes.

93
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:05,900
I said I didn't want to,
so let's take a break for now.

94
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:14,640
Why does it have to take this long?

95
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:18,720
Looks like arresting our senior
officer turned out to be great publicity.

96
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:21,500
Damn, we ended up cooperating after all.

97
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:24,960
No, they're all beauties on par with models.

98
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:27,160
I'd like to get arrested too.

99
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,920
What a huge response!

100
00:06:30,380 --> 00:06:33,400
Apparently requests for their
photo book keep pouring in.

101
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,960
Hey, look at this!

102
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:37,280
They're even planning to
make figurines of them!

103
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,600
Just like idols

104
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:41,680
Right, we're going to do it too!

105
00:06:43,060 --> 00:06:44,600
Wild Guys Squad?

106
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,260
Why would you make something like that?

107
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:49,640
We can't leave it all to the women.

108
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:51,840
Does the Chief approve?

109
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,980
No, we only just made it today.

110
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:58,200
But we'll make him acknowledge
us by performing brilliantly!

111
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:01,180
We've got a call...

112
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:05,860
Snatch team in pursuit! Location: Kameari intersection,
heading toward Kanna!

113
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:09,260
It's right nearby! Angel Seven, deploy!

114
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,940
The Wild Guys are going out too!

115
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,440
Did we just hit something?

116
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:23,500
From the front too!

117
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:31,780
You can't run anymore, you know.

118
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:32,300
Damn it!

119
00:07:33,460 --> 00:07:33,900
Are you all right?

120
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:34,920
Yeah.

121
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,700
Getting caught by a woman,
that's just your own fault.

122
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:39,580
Move, move!

123
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:41,060
Our opponent is over here!

124
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,640
Help me!

125
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,920
Damn it!

126
00:07:55,580 --> 00:07:57,440
Beep beep!

127
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:01,760
Ugh!

128
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:03,880
Eeeeeh!

129
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,460
Aaaaaah!

130
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:12,340
Sorry, sorry~!

131
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,280
Aaaaaah!

132
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,020
Ugh!

133
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:47,760
Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!

134
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:49,740
We're going to get thoroughly wild!

135
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,020
Stop right there.

136
00:08:54,020 --> 00:08:55,400
I'll punish you.

137
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,960
Running off won't get you anywhere,
you know.

138
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:00,680
One:

139
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:03,200
sucking the lifeblood from
the people of this world,

140
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,420
Two:

141
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:06,280
the wicked deeds of friends, left behind,

142
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,820
Three:

143
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:10,120
the ugly evil of this world,

144
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:13,720
we'll take it down for you.

145
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:15,880
Barbar!

146
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:18,260
We won't stand by and let the evil go on.

147
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:19,880
We'll see you sentenced.

148
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:27,360
You can't be serious,
doing something like that.

149
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,920
That went too far.

150
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,040
Idiot!

151
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:40,380
This makes us look like an evil syndicate.

152
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:44,580
We realize that what we did this time went too far,
so we're reflecting on it,

153
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:48,860
and we were hoping you
could officially approve it.

154
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:51,140
Do you think I'd approve
something like this?

155
00:09:51,140 --> 00:09:52,880
The squad is disbanded,
effective immediately!

156
00:09:55,340 --> 00:09:56,480
Sorry.

157
00:10:02,340 --> 00:10:03,540
Speeding violation.

158
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:09,680
Hey, black motorcycle over there,
how fast were you going?

159
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,640
Pull over to the side and stop.

160
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,540
Don't you recognize the culprit?

161
00:10:35,780 --> 00:10:37,740
I couldn't see his face, he had a helmet on.

162
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,680
Or maybe you're the culprit yourself.

163
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,760
W-what?

164
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,740
Yeah, forming a squad like the Wild Guys,

165
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:52,400
you've got it in for us! Don't be ridiculous.
I'm not so uncouth as to lay a hand on a woman.

166
00:10:56,120 --> 00:11:00,500
Another attack? Got it, I'm on my way.

167
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:07,420
So the Angel Seven were attacked again Yes,
we're rushing to the scene.

168
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,540
Roger, we're on it here too.

169
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,100
Erika, are you all right?

170
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,220
What kind of guy was the culprit?

171
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:24,020
It's an old Honda Nana-han.

172
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,500
A CB750?

173
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:29,280
Yes, it was black.

174
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:30,340
What about the plate number?

175
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:34,840
I tried to look,
but the plate was bent back.

176
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:44,220
Was it the bosozoku?

177
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:03,640
Don't go flashing around on that bike, punk!

178
00:12:07,220 --> 00:12:08,580
So you're the culprit.

179
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:49,460
Kanto Otoko Rengo

180
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:55,640
Kanto Otoko Rengo, you say?

181
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:56,780
You know them?

182
00:12:59,400 --> 00:12:59,940
What?

183
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:04,480
That's the biker gang you led before you joined the police,
isn't it?

184
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,380
If it's a biker gang,
they'd do something like this.

185
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:09,940
W-wait a moment!

186
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:12,000
Sure, they're a biker gang,

187
00:13:12,050 --> 00:13:16,080
but I don't think Kanto Otoko
Rengo would ever hurt anyone.

188
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,940
Don't let personal feelings get
in the way of the investigation.

189
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:19,960
Let's go.

190
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,500
Yes.

191
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:33,460
It wasn't me! It must be some mistake!

192
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:35,660
Don't you dare take our picture!

193
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:37,480
Don't you dare struggle!

194
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:44,720
Honda-san, I didn't do it.

195
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,020
Please help me.

196
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:49,100
You're not lying to me, are you?

197
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:53,820
Let's go.

198
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,060
Doesn't that make five arrests?

199
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:07,800
They were the same height
and dressed exactly alike.

200
00:14:08,420 --> 00:14:11,720
The bike was also the same old-model CB750.

201
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:13,620
Where's the bike?

202
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:17,620
It's in the backyard at my place, but
I don't think searching will do any good.

203
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:26,740
Looks like it's the same
bike the Angel Seven guys saw.

204
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:29,820
Senpai, take a look.

205
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:31,640
What is it?

206
00:14:32,180 --> 00:14:36,320
The suspect said the
plate was bent back, right?

207
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,920
But didn't you fix it?

208
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,640
Take a good look.

209
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:43,400
There's no sign it was ever bent back.

210
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:46,100
Yeah, you're right.

211
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:49,640
I think the plate is white.

212
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:59,100
Now we can patrol with peace of mind.

213
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:02,040
Yes, then we'll head that way.

214
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:17,200
Officers Miwa and Sato were attacked?

215
00:15:18,220 --> 00:15:21,060
We've had Taisei-kun go to the hospital.

216
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:24,420
We arrested the culprit, so what's going on?

217
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:27,660
It means the real culprit is someone else.

218
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:32,360
Hijikata was in the interrogation room at the time of the crime,
after all.

219
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:37,400
Looks like the real culprit didn't
know Hijikata had been arrested.

220
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,560
The real culprit attacked the Angel Seven,

221
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:44,360
and it seems their aim was
to pin the crime on Hijikata.

222
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,740
But by making that leap,
they dug their own grave.

223
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:50,480
I'll catch the real culprit myself,
without fail.

224
00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:56,260
Sakai-san, I think the real culprit will come after you two,
the last ones left.

225
00:15:57,120 --> 00:16:00,060
I-I'm quitting the Angel Seven!

226
00:16:01,300 --> 00:16:02,880
Wait, Sakai-san!

227
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:06,920
I'll protect you without fail,
so please be the decoy.

228
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:10,440
Decoy? No way.

229
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:12,360
Anyway, I'm quitting.

230
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:14,820
Sakai-san.

231
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:21,760
I can't be the decoy either.

232
00:16:22,700 --> 00:16:24,280
I'll be the decoy.

233
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:27,400
Nana-chan

234
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:31,800
If we wear helmets, the culprits
probably won't be able to tell us apart.

235
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,000
But...

236
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:38,040
If Honda-san will protect me,
I'm not scared.

237
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:40,180
Nana-chan

238
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:45,920
Alright, we'll reform the
Wild Guys squad and help out!

239
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,540
Wait, senpai.

240
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:49,265
Excuse me, but...

241
00:16:49,315 --> 00:16:53,880
Please let me handle this job alone.

242
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:56,300
What?

243
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:17,960
Honda's here!

244
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:18,880
Roger.

245
00:17:19,340 --> 00:17:21,040
Ryotsu-san, open up!

246
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:22,100
Right.

247
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:23,400
Right.

248
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:30,200
Alright!

249
00:17:38,180 --> 00:17:42,840
Hey, the moment the suspect shows up,
get onto the sidewalk and stop that scooter.

250
00:17:43,220 --> 00:17:43,580
Yes.

251
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:48,920
Did they notice us?

252
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:53,200
Hey, CB750 over there, stop!

253
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:56,780
Now this is interesting.

254
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:09,920
Damn it, this is a public road
and he's speeding like crazy!

255
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,660
Honda-san!

256
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,140
Don't worry.

257
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:22,460
There's a transmitter on
the front of Honda's bike.

258
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:30,920
I'm getting excited, bro.

259
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:47,480
Dozens of police badges

260
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:49,900
How can you make that
kind of counterargument?

261
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,080
Not bad, Okita!

262
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:55,720
Because I'm following you, bro,

263
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:57,300
I'm at my limit, man.

264
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:00,180
Okita!

265
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,660
I've made up my mind.

266
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:03,560
You'll take over from me

267
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:07,900
You're the one who will become the
second head of Kanto Otoko Rengo.

268
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:09,820
Brother.

269
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:13,860
To someone who can love
bikes and love the wind,

270
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:16,600
I've wanted to hand over the head position.

271
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,600
Okita, you'll take over, won't you?

272
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:23,700
Yes! The Kanto Otoko Rengo you built,

273
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:26,680
I'll make it the most
manly biker gang there is!

274
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:32,920
No doubt about it, it's Okita.

275
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:37,680
Hey, you, Ryuji.

276
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:40,660
So it really was him.

277
00:19:41,060 --> 00:19:43,180
Why the hell did you
pull such a stupid stunt?

278
00:19:44,540 --> 00:19:48,260
I just couldn't stand how lazy
the Kanto Otoko Rengo had gotten.

279
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:53,400
Ever since I quit, they've been putting girls
in the sidecar and cruising around showing off.

280
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:56,280
They've sunk to being a bosozoku
gang that picks up girls.

281
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:58,580
Then why didn't you just say so?

282
00:19:59,180 --> 00:20:00,120
I did say so.

283
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:03,640
And do you know what Hijikata said?

284
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:06,642
Okita-san,

285
00:20:06,692 --> 00:20:10,900
times have changed since your day,
Okita-san, and Honda-san's.

286
00:20:11,620 --> 00:20:12,320
What did you say?

287
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:16,340
Bikes are for riding
happily with your girlfriend.

288
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,385
Loving the wind and all that,

289
00:20:18,435 --> 00:20:22,140
the days of man-this and man-that are over.

290
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:29,260
I understand how you feel, it hurts.

291
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:30,100
But you know,

292
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:32,920
dragging the Angel Seven into this,
who have nothing to do with it,

293
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,580
was wrong.

294
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,460
Missus, carry out the plan.

295
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:38,840
Do that only after you beat me, will you?

296
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:39,240
Big brother.

297
00:20:40,020 --> 00:20:40,380
What?

298
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:48,140
That's reckless.

299
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:02,180
Size.

300
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:15,740
Honda's police bike has
disappeared from the navigation.

301
00:21:16,300 --> 00:21:16,900
What?!

302
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:22,360
Honda!

303
00:21:24,420 --> 00:21:26,280
Honda!

304
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:28,960
Honda!

305
00:21:31,600 --> 00:21:33,080
Honda's...

306
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:37,760
He'd never die on the bike he loves.

307
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:46,480
There he is!

308
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:47,480
It's Honda!

309
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:48,940
Honda!

310
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,300
Hey! Honda!

311
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,960
Are you all right, Okita?

312
00:21:57,960 --> 00:22:00,480
Looks like my leg fell off.

313
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:01,780
Honda!

314
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,120
Honda!

315
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:06,300
Way to go, Honda!

316
00:22:06,300 --> 00:22:08,060
Honda, are you all right?

317
00:22:08,360 --> 00:22:08,840
Yeah.

318
00:22:17,580 --> 00:22:21,220
Got it, Honda.

319
00:22:22,300 --> 00:22:26,740
Okita's like a little brother to me.
Senpai, please.

320
00:22:29,940 --> 00:22:30,620
I see.

321
00:22:34,820 --> 00:22:38,240
Doesn't look like you can walk.
Come on, get on.

322
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:40,780
Sorry for the trouble.

323
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:44,220
Big brother.

324
00:22:45,560 --> 00:22:47,860
You haven't changed at all from the old days,
big brother.

325
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:49,420
I was happy.

326
00:22:49,420 --> 00:22:52,320
Don't give me that crap, you goddamn idiot.

327
00:22:57,260 --> 00:22:58,320
Honda-san.

328
00:22:58,720 --> 00:22:59,500
Oda-hime.

329
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:02,620
Leave him be.

330
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:29,520
What, are you running
even though you could die?

331
00:23:29,520 --> 00:23:32,640
That's why the biker
gang walks all over you.

332
00:23:33,020 --> 00:23:34,380
Hit the corners hard!

333
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:35,120
Yes!

334
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:39,560
Looks like Honda's finally
back to his old self.

335
00:23:40,780 --> 00:23:41,960
It's the usual Honda-san.

336
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:45,440
Honda-san! I made sandwiches!

337
00:23:45,860 --> 00:23:47,420
Please eat them!

338
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:51,760
Na-na-chan!

339
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:54,640
How happy I am, oh how happy I am!

340
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,074
Sandwiches,

341
00:23:56,124 --> 00:23:58,880
sandwiches, sandwiches!

342
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,360
They look delicious!

343
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:03,440
Hey, let's eat together, Nana-chan.

344
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,060
I wonder why

345
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:23,980
Ryo-san's eyebrows look like black seagulls

346
00:24:23,980 --> 00:24:25,000
I wonder why

347
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:30,420
Even in sandals, he can run so fast

348
00:24:30,420 --> 00:24:31,520
I wonder why

349
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:38,320
Ryo-san always has his sleeves rolled up

350
00:24:38,320 --> 00:24:39,340
I wonder why

351
00:24:40,780 --> 00:24:45,780
He's a total mess, yet everyone looks up to him.
I wonder why

352
00:24:45,780 --> 00:24:47,900
I wonder why

353
00:24:48,540 --> 00:24:51,640
It doesn't really matter, but

354
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:58,400
Why is this anime's title so long?

355
00:24:58,400 --> 00:25:01,180
Here it debuts:
Katsushika-ku Kameari Kōen-mae Hashutsujo!

356
00:25:01,180 --> 00:25:02,860
Why is that?

357
00:25:02,860 --> 00:25:05,400
Why is that?

358
00:25:07,120 --> 00:25:08,560
Why is that?

359
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:09,740
Why is that?

360
00:25:10,780 --> 00:25:12,300
Why? Why is that?

361
00:25:12,980 --> 00:25:15,500
Why is that? Why is that?

362
00:25:15,840 --> 00:25:19,040
Why? Why? Why? Why is that?

363
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:32,720
Kankichi! Mikan is really cute, isn't she?

364
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:36,340
Come on, Lemon-nee-chan is
going to take her for a walk!

365
00:25:37,140 --> 00:25:39,640
Oh no, this is terrible! Mikan has a fever!

366
00:25:40,780 --> 00:25:43,540
It's because she went along on the walk...
what do we do, Kankichin?

367
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:47,500
Next time: Lemon's child-rearing struggles,
see you then!

